in weeks.',\n    90→      tags: JSON.stringify(['music', 'guitar', 'learning']),\n    91→    },\n    92→    {\n    93→      title: 'History of Jazz Music',\n    94→      body: 'Jazz originated in the African-American communities of New Orleans in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. It blends elements of blues, ragtime, and European harmony. Key figures include Louis Armstrong, Duke Ellington, Charlie Parker, and Miles Davis. Jazz has evolved through many styles including swing, bebop, and fusion.',\n    95→      tags: JSON.stringify(['music', 'history', 'jazz']),\n    96→    },\n    97→    {\n    98→      title: 'React Hooks Deep Dive',\n    99→      body: 'React Hooks allow you to use state and other React features without writing class components. useState manages local state, useEffect handles side effects, useContext accesses context, and useMemo optimizes performance. Custom hooks let you extract reusable stateful logic.',\n   100→      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'react', 'javascript']),\n   101→    },\n   102→    {\n   103→      title: 'Docker Container Essentials',\n   104→      body: 'Docker containers package applications with their dependencies into standardized units for development, shipment, and deployment. Containers are lightweight, portable, and consistent across environments. Key concepts include images, containers, volumes, networks, and docker-compose for multi-container applications.',\n   105→      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'devops', 'docker']),\n   106→    },\n   107→    {\n   108→      title: 'Mediterranean Diet Benefits',\n   109→      body: 'The Mediterranean diet emphasizes fruits, vegetables, whole grains, legumes, nuts, and olive oil. It includes moderate amounts of fish, poultry, and dairy, with limited red meat. Studies show it reduces risk of heart disease, stroke, type 2 diabetes, and cognitive decline.',\n   110→      tags: JSON.stringify(['health', 'nutrition', 'diet']),\n   111→    },\n   112→    {\n   113→